{
  "shots": [
    {
      "sentence": "I have worked the night shift at the lighthouse for ten years.",
      "search_term": "lighthouse night",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A silhouette of a lighthouse standing against a dark, moody night sky.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_1.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 1.681
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The isolation is usually a comfort, but tonight felt different.",
      "search_term": "person looking window",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person sitting alone in a dimly lit, vintage room looking out a window.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_2.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 2.942
    },
    {
      "sentence": "A thick, unnatural fog pressed against the glass, muffling every sound.",
      "search_term": "thick fog window",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "Dense, swirling fog rolling past a glass window pane at night.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_3.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.962
    },
    {
      "sentence": "At midnight, the emergency alarm began to blare throughout the tower.",
      "search_term": "emergency alarm light",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A close-up of a vintage red emergency alarm light flashing in the dark.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_4.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.162
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I checked the rotating beacon, but the bulb was burning perfectly bright.",
      "search_term": "lighthouse beam rotating",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A bright, rotating lighthouse beam cutting through the darkness.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_5.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.222
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Then, a frantic knocking echoed from the heavy iron door downstairs.",
      "search_term": "metal door knocking",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A heavy, rusted metal door being struck from the outside.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_6.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.162
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I froze because the nearest town is twenty miles across the sea.",
      "search_term": "dark ocean waves",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "Dark, turbulent ocean waves crashing against jagged rocks at night.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_7.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 2.742
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I grabbed the security monitor, hoping to catch a glimpse of the visitor.",
      "search_term": "security camera monitor",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A hand reaching for a grainy, old-fashioned security monitor screen.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_8.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.022
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The screen flickered to life, showing the narrow stone path outside.",
      "search_term": "security camera footage",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A grainy, black and white view of a desolate stone path at night.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_9.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.182
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The path was completely empty, yet the knocking grew louder and faster.",
      "search_term": "empty stone path",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "An empty, dark stone pathway leading to a building.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_10.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.643
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I mustered my courage and stepped down the spiral staircase to investigate.",
      "search_term": "spiral staircase dark",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A dark, narrow spiral staircase winding downwards.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_11.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.283
    },
    {
      "sentence": "With a shaking hand, I pulled the lever to swing the door open.",
      "search_term": "shaking hand door",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A close-up of a hand trembling while grabbing a heavy metal door handle.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_12.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 2.602
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Nobody stood there, but a small, wet footprint sat on the threshold.",
      "search_term": "wet footprint floor",
      "media_type": "photo",
      "visual": "A single, wet, mysterious footprint on a cold stone floor.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_13.jpg",
      "duration_seconds": 3.382
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It wasn't a human print, but the mark of something far more ancient.",
      "search_term": "monster footprint",
      "media_type": "photo",
      "visual": "A close-up of a strange, clawed footprint in the dirt.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_14.jpg",
      "duration_seconds": 2.902
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I looked up, and my blood turned to ice as I saw the truth.",
      "search_term": "person looking scared",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person's face looking up in pure terror, dimly lit.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_15.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 2.781
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The lighthouse wasn't warning ships away from the jagged rocks tonight.",
      "search_term": "ship dark ocean",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A ship silhouette barely visible in the stormy, dark sea.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_16.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 2.861
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The beacon was actually signaling to something waiting in the dark water.",
      "search_term": "light underwater dark",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A bright light shining down into deep, black, mysterious water.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_17.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.002
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I turned to run, but the heavy iron door slammed shut on its own.",
      "search_term": "door slamming shut",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A heavy metal door slamming shut violently in the dark.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_18.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.282
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I realized then that the lighthouse wasn't built to save lives at all.",
      "search_term": "lonely lighthouse ocean",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A wide shot of a lonely lighthouse surrounded by endless dark water.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_19.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 2.682
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It was built to keep whatever was knocking from ever leaving.",
      "search_term": "locked metal door",
      "media_type": "photo",
      "visual": "The lighthouse door locked tight with heavy chains and shadows.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_20.jpg",
      "duration_seconds": 2.342
    }
  ],
